{"cues":[{"sectionId":"intro","start":0,"end":53.92},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":54.8,"end":107.52},{"sectionId":"practice","start":110.595,"end":156.64},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":158,"end":210.56}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"intro","start":0,"end":3.6,"text":"這一章我們要讓同一個個人首頁換一個外觀。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":4.2,"end":6.88,"text":"你已經知道 HTML 放內容；"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":7.44,"end":11.28,"text":"CSS 則讓我們在保留內容結構的情況下，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":11.36,"end":13.04,"text":"調整它的呈現方式。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":14.16,"end":18.96,"text":"請先分清楚三個常用設定：color 控制文字的顏色，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":19.6,"end":21.6,"text":"background 控制背景色，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":22.32,"end":26.32,"text":"padding 則是內容到元素邊緣之間的內部空間。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":27.36,"end":30.32,"text":"例如按鈕上的文字很貼邊時，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":30.64,"end":32.48,"text":"通常應該調整內距，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":32.76,"end":35.36,"text":"而不是在文字前面塞空格。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":36,"end":41.52,"text":"我們今天的實作會先把按鈕底色從紫色改成綠色。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":42.48,"end":43.52,"text":"請你先想一想，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":43.8,"end":46,"text":"要改的是按鈕上的字，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":46.4,"end":48.96,"text":"還是文字後面的那一塊顏色？"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":49.76,"end":51.52,"text":"分清楚這兩件事，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":51.6,"end":53.92,"text":"才不會選錯 CSS 屬性。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":54.8,"end":55.84,"text":"請看老師示範。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":57.2,"end":58.08,"text":"打開 style."},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":58.32,"end":59.04,"text":"css，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":59.52,"end":61.6,"text":"找到 button 的樣式規則。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":62.64,"end":64.4,"text":"button 是選取目標，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":64.72,"end":68.8,"text":"告訴瀏覽器這些設定要套用到按鈕；"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":69.2,"end":71.76,"text":"大括號裡面則是各項樣式。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":72.2,"end":73.84,"text":"我們找到 background，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":74.4,"end":79.28,"text":"將原本的紫色色碼換成畫面上提供的綠色色碼。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":80.4,"end":82.8,"text":"這種井字號開頭的表示法，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":83.12,"end":86.16,"text":"是用十六進位數字描述顏色，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":86.48,"end":89.2,"text":"你現在不需要背下每一個數值。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":90.32,"end":92.12,"text":"修改後觀察預覽，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":92.4,"end":93.92,"text":"按鈕底色改變了，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":94.24,"end":96.16,"text":"文字內容並沒有更換。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":97.2,"end":101.36,"text":"請特別留意：我們改的是 button 規則中的背景，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":101.68,"end":103.6,"text":"不是整個頁面的背景。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":104.48,"end":105.76,"text":"看完這個差異，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":105.88,"end":107.52,"text":"再進入自己的練習。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":110.595,"end":111.12,"text":"現在請你開啟 style."},{"sectionId":"practice","start":111.38,"end":112.16,"text":"css，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":112.6,"end":114.64,"text":"在 button 的樣式規則裡，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":114.92,"end":118.4,"text":"把 background 換成畫面提供的綠色色碼。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":119.52,"end":122.48,"text":"修改時保留屬性後面的冒號，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":122.747,"end":124.8,"text":"以及設定結尾的分號。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":125.84,"end":129.6,"text":"完成後先看按鈕是否變綠，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":129.88,"end":131.68,"text":"再儲存並驗證。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":132.133,"end":134.8,"text":"如果變色的是整個頁面，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":135.12,"end":137.12,"text":"可能是改到了 body 的背景；"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":137.92,"end":139.44,"text":"如果文字變綠，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":139.68,"end":141.36,"text":"可能是改到了 color。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":142.08,"end":146,"text":"這兩個現象都能幫你判斷問題出在哪裡。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":147.12,"end":148.8,"text":"這頁結束會暫停，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":149.08,"end":152.48,"text":"你可以對照程式碼和預覽慢慢檢查。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":153.2,"end":154.4,"text":"驗證通過後，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":154.56,"end":156.64,"text":"再看下一頁的成果整理。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":158,"end":160.32,"text":"來確認一下這次的修改範圍。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":161.12,"end":163.76,"text":"按鈕底色應該已經變成綠色；"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":164.56,"end":169.84,"text":"HTML 裡寫的文字和 JavaScript 原本安排的點擊反應，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":170.16,"end":173.44,"text":"並沒有因為這個樣式修改而被重寫。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":174.48,"end":179.12,"text":"這就是把內容、外觀與行為分開處理的好處。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":180.16,"end":186.32,"text":"現在你也可以解釋三個 CSS 設定：文字顏色看 color，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":187.12,"end":189.04,"text":"背景色看 background，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":189.92,"end":192.72,"text":"內容四周的空間看 padding。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":193.36,"end":196.72,"text":"本章驗證的是指定底色的修改；"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":197.52,"end":199.92,"text":"之後你可以用相同方法，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":200.2,"end":202.96,"text":"一次調整一個設定並觀察。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":203.92,"end":207.36,"text":"下一章我們要讓按鈕在被點擊之後，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":207.68,"end":210.56,"text":"顯示自己指定的問候文字。"}]}